WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.000
<v Sophie Lim>Hi Michelle, thanks for joining. You mentioned in the app that you were curious about investing in Tesla.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Michelle Ng>Yes. I've been reading about Tesla a lot lately, and I'm thinking of buying some Tesla shares.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
<v Sophie Lim>Sure, let's go through it. How much were you thinking of putting in, and where would the money come from?

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Michelle Ng>My time deposit ending 4410 matures tomorrow. It's SGD 150,000. I was thinking of using about SGD 20,000 of it for Tesla.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:52.000
<v Sophie Lim>Okay. Your main portfolio is an advised mandate of about SGD 1.18 million, so a single stock would sit alongside it. Before you decide, there are a few things to check.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:05.000
<v Sophie Lim>First, a single stock can move a lot more than a diversified portfolio, so we need to check it fits your risk profile. Second, I'll check how much US tech you already hold, so you're not too concentrated.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
<v Michelle Ng>That makes sense. I don't want too much in one company.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:23.000
<v Sophie Lim>I'll run the suitability and concentration check and send you the bank's latest research on Tesla by Thursday the 12th. I can't tell you whether to buy, but you'll have the facts to decide.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:31.000
<v Michelle Ng>Okay. Should I hold back the SGD 20,000 when the deposit matures?

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:42.000
<v Sophie Lim>That's your choice. One option is to keep SGD 20,000 as cash for now and renew the rest. I'll send you the renewal options today so you can choose before it matures tomorrow.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:50.000
<v Michelle Ng>Let's do that. I'll reply by tomorrow morning to confirm.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:02.000
<v Michelle Ng>If I go ahead, I'd like an investment specialist to explain the risks before I place the order.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:11.000
<v Sophie Lim>Of course. Once you've read the research, I'll set up a call with our investment specialist. You place the order only after that.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:20.000
<v Sophie Lim>Two quick things before we finish. You asked about adding your mother as a joint holder. I'll send the requirements by Monday the 16th.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:29.000
<v Sophie Lim>And for your periodic review, proof of address is still outstanding. I'll send you the updated checklist tomorrow.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.000
<v Michelle Ng>Okay. I'll upload the proof of address this week.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:44.000
<v Sophie Lim>Great. I'll also send you a short summary of today's call, so you have everything in one place.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:49.000
<v Michelle Ng>Thanks Sophie, that's really helpful.
